{"id":"27600136f2","t":"My Younger Sister Was a Genius","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2024-04-10-04-25-19-1712766319074-193x278.jpg","n":96,"l":95,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius"},"u":1795038230068,"desc":"لقد ضحى هاجون يون بعائلته بينما يواصل مسيرته غير الناجحة كمغني يتمتع بموهبة غامضة. “ليتني فقط أستطيع العودة بالزمن إلى الوراء…” ! وفي صباح أحد الأيام، بعد أن أمضيت كل يوم في الندم والشرب، استيقظت لأجد نفسيّ في الماضي. ثم أدركت أن أختي الأصغر كانت عبقريًا في الغناء… ! حان الوقت لتغيير نفسي تصبح أختي الأصغر أفضل مغنية!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","دراما","شريحة من الحياة","فنتازيا","موسيقى"],"src":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/1/"},"2":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/2/"},"3":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/3/"},"4":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/4/"},"5":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/5/"},"6":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/6/"},"7":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/7/"},"8":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/8/"},"9":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/9/"},"10":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/10/"},"11":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/11/"},"12":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/12/"},"13":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/13/"},"14":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/14/"},"15":{"ml":"my-younger-sister-was-a-genius|/manga/my-younger-sister-was-a-genius/15/"}